Package: jmsbattery
Title: JMS Test Battery (psychTestR)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anton", "Schreiber", email = "anton.schreiber@uni-hamburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: psychTestR test battery for the JMS study: demographics (DEG),
    rhythm (RAT) and beat perception (CA-BAT), working memory (JAJ), Gold-MSI
    short version (GMS), musical growth mindset (TOM) and the Drum Machine
    Test (DMT), followed by an optional block (GRT, CCM, MPT) that
    participants can skip.
